speechtext:
Moved by Mr. I Browne (St. John's West):
That Bill No. C-38, an act to provide for the reporting of financial and other statistics relating to the affairs of corporations and labour unions carrying on activities in Canada, be amended by striking out paragraph (a) of subsection (1) of section 2 thereof and substituting therefor the following:
(a) "Minister" means the Minister of Trade and Commerce;
